          <ul style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#495057', margin: 0, paddingLeft: 16 }}>
            <li>Test pass/fail results (Math.random)</li>
            <li>API calls (no real backend)</li>
            <li>Database operations (no DB server)</li>
            <li>Test data generation (random values)</li>
            <li>Duration values (randomized)</li>
          </ul>
